    "created_at": "2018-01-16T11:09:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-16T11:09:48Z",
    "body": "I wonder if a simpler solution here would be to exclude '&' from the definition of text and only include it when we don't also include character references. And then define unambiguous ampersands or some such and allow those too.",
